<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Resolver Application Update</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f7f7f7;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .highlight {
        color: #1d4ed8;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .reason {
        margin: 20px 0;
        padding: 16px;
        background: #fef2f2;
        border: 1px solid #fecaca;
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: #b91c1c;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>An Update on Your Resolver Application</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>
        Thank you for applying to become a resolver with City Sense. After
        careful review, we regret to inform you that we are unable to approve
        your application at this time.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our team provided the following reason for the decision:
      </p>
      <div class="reason">
        <p><%= rejectionReason %></p>
      </div>
      <p>
        We encourage you to address the areas mentioned above and consider
        applying again in the future. If you have any questions, feel free to
        reach out to us.
      </p>
      <p>
        Best regards,<br />
        <span class="highlight">City Sense Team</span>
      </p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; <%= year %> City Sense. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>